• Findings:

  - `scripts/land/install-bot.sh:41` — a fresh clone logs `INSTALL_ORIGIN_URL` verbatim, leaking any URL credentials despite the new redaction elsewhere. Fix by piping `ORIGIN_URL` through `redact` in this message too. Add a fresh-clone test with credentialed input and assert that no userinfo appears.

